  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. Halve snacking tomatoes. Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges. Grate carrot (see ingredients).\n• In a small bowl, combine dried oregano (see ingredients), lemon zest, a squeeze of lemon juice and the honey.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c50afbf0a31bc0c3010616-207e2b85.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add carrot, and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes. Add the water and vegetable stock pot (see ingredients) and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and currants, stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c50afbf0a31bc0c3010616-854874bb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When couscous has 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut into 1cm slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.\n• Remove from heat, and return haloumi to pan and add honey-lemon mixture, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c50afbf0a31bc0c3010616-1202b8ba.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In large bowl, combine snacking tomatoes, spinach & rocket mix and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide jewelled couscous and cherry tomato salad between bowls. Top with citrus haloumi.\n• Drizzle over creamy pesto dressing. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c50afbf0a31bc0c3010616-7e1749c1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
